// BaselScript SCENE definition
//
// Format:
// type;start_keyword;value_separator;end_prefix;end_contains;implicit_next_start;implicit_eof;name_required
//
// This file describes the special legacy SCENE grammar.
// It intentionally does not use blocks.def because SCENE has
// implicit boundaries and a different END grammar.

SCENE;scene;=;end;scene;true;true;true
